        "segment_id": "seg_007",
        "speaker": "Participant",
        "segment_type": "continue_divert_decision",
        "raw_interview_anchor": "The plan all along had been Lisbon with Porto as backup... Diverting felt like abandoning a plan that had held up reasonably well.",
